+<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 780 514" font-family="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" role="img" aria-labelledby="t">
+<title id="t">One dragon's turn in textbook-main-0025, from reading the turn to the radio</title>
+<defs><marker id="flow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto"><path d="M0 0L10 5L0 10z" fill="#263d31"/></marker><marker id="back" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto"><path d="M0 0L10 5L0 10z" fill="#b53b13"/></marker><marker id="dim" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto"><path d="M0 0L10 5L0 10z" fill="#66675e"/></marker></defs>
+<rect width="780" height="514" fill="#ede5d5"/>
+<text x="40" y="40" font-size="20" font-weight="bold" fill="#20251f" text-anchor="start">One dragon's turn</text>
+<rect x="40" y="64" width="216" height="112" rx="8" fill="#f6f1e7" stroke="#b9ad99" stroke-width="1.5"/><text x="54" y="89" font-size="15" font-weight="bold" fill="#20251f" text-anchor="start">1. Read the turn</text><text x="54" y="110" font-size="12.5" font-weight="normal" fill="#66675e" text-anchor="start">controller.readTurn: the</text><text x="54" y="128" font-size="12.5" font-weight="normal" fill="#66675e" text-anchor="start">window, sonar and echoes</text>
+<rect x="282" y="64" width="216" height="112" rx="8" fill="#263d31" stroke="#263d31" stroke-width="1.5"/><text x="296" y="89" font-size="15" font-weight="bold" fill="#ede5d5" text-anchor="start">2. World model</text><text x="296" y="110" font-size="12.5" font-weight="normal" fill="#ede5d5" text-anchor="start">memory.update: facts with</text><text x="296" y="128" font-size="12.5" font-weight="normal" fill="#ede5d5" text-anchor="start">source and round; then the</text><text x="296" y="146" font-size="12.5" font-weight="normal" fill="#ede5d5" text-anchor="start">belief's filters</text>
+<path d="M258 120.0 L280 120.0" fill="none" stroke="#263d31" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linejoin="round" marker-end="url(#flow)"/>
+<rect x="524" y="64" width="216" height="112" rx="8" fill="#263d31" stroke="#263d31" stroke-width="1.5"/><text x="538" y="89" font-size="15" font-weight="bold" fill="#ede5d5" text-anchor="start">3. Roles</text><text x="538" y="110" font-size="12.5" font-weight="normal" fill="#ede5d5" text-anchor="start">roles.decide: the same</text><text x="538" y="128" font-size="12.5" font-weight="normal" fill="#ede5d5" text-anchor="start">assignment, run on this</text><text x="538" y="146" font-size="12.5" font-weight="normal" fill="#ede5d5" text-anchor="start">dragon's own picture</text>
+<path d="M500 120.0 L522 120.0" fill="none" stroke="#263d31" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linejoin="round" marker-end="url(#flow)"/>
+<rect x="40" y="216" width="216" height="112" rx="8" fill="#263d31" stroke="#263d31" stroke-width="1.5"/><text x="54" y="241" font-size="15" font-weight="bold" fill="#ede5d5" text-anchor="start">4. Task selection</text><text x="54" y="262" font-size="12.5" font-weight="normal" fill="#ede5d5" text-anchor="start">every (behaviour, target)</text><text x="54" y="280" font-size="12.5" font-weight="normal" fill="#ede5d5" text-anchor="start">pair its role allows, kept</text><text x="54" y="298" font-size="12.5" font-weight="normal" fill="#ede5d5" text-anchor="start">within a margin of 2</text>
+<rect x="282" y="216" width="216" height="112" rx="8" fill="#263d31" stroke="#263d31" stroke-width="1.5"/><text x="296" y="241" font-size="15" font-weight="bold" fill="#ede5d5" text-anchor="start">5. State machine</text><text x="296" y="262" font-size="12.5" font-weight="normal" fill="#ede5d5" text-anchor="start">interrupts first: give way,</text><text x="296" y="280" font-size="12.5" font-weight="normal" fill="#ede5d5" text-anchor="start">rescue, evade; then the</text><text x="296" y="298" font-size="12.5" font-weight="normal" fill="#ede5d5" text-anchor="start">task's phases</text>
